# Graphics trim, batch 10: disabled because PikoPixel is a GNUstep application.
#
# The graphics product ships pikopixel.app. Purging the GNUstep runtime takes
# PikoPixel with it, so this batch is retained as a record but is not applied.
# If PikoPixel is ever dropped from tasks.list, enable this list and re-check
# the graphics anchors.
#
# tools/build-live.sh does not apply this file. It is retained as the measured
# record of the collision: applying the batch would remove PikoPixel's GNUstep
# runtime. If PikoPixel is ever dropped from the product, enable it and re-check
# the graphics anchors.

gnustep-back-common
gnustep-back0.32
gnustep-back0.32-cairo
gnustep-base-common
gnustep-base-runtime
gnustep-common
gnustep-gui-common
gnustep-gui-runtime
gnustep-multiarch
libgnustep-base1.31
libgnustep-gui0.32
